        {
          "_type": "UMLPackage",
          "_id": "c4-pkg-2056",
          "_parent": {
            "$ref": "c4-model-0002"
          },
          "name": "3.4 — Components · Zoom Projector",
          "documentation": "Inside project.mjs. Turns click telemetry into the zoom regions the compositor animates. The output is a hand-editable JSON project, and explicit regions always beat auto-zoom.",
          "ownedElements": [
            {
              "_type": "UMLClass",
              "_id": "c4-el-2057",
              "_parent": {
                "$ref": "c4-pkg-2056"
              },
              "name": "Telemetry reader",
              "stereotype": {
                "$ref": "c4-st-0009"
              },
              "documentation": "Technology: project.mjs\n\nTakes the cursor.json beside the newest take, cut.mp4 before raw.mp4, and keeps the clicks. No clicks is an error rather than an empty project."
            },
            {
              "_type": "UMLClass",
              "_id": "c4-el-2058",
              "_parent": {
                "$ref": "c4-pkg-2056"
              },
              "name": "Click clusterer",
              "stereotype": {
                "$ref": "c4-st-0009"
              },
              "documentation": "Technology: project.mjs\n\nClicks less than 2500ms apart (ZOOM_MERGE_MS), with no page open between them (opens.json), become one region — opening a menu and picking an item is one move to the viewer, not two."
            },
            {
              "_type": "UMLClass",
              "_id": "c4-el-2059",
              "_parent": {
                "$ref": "c4-pkg-2056"
              },
              "name": "Flutter guard",
              "stereotype": {
                "$ref": "c4-st-0009"
              },
              "documentation": "Technology: project.mjs\n\nTwo regions that would sit less than 800ms apart are merged, so the zoom holds instead of bouncing out and straight back in."
            },
            {
              "_type": "UMLClass",
              "_id": "c4-el-2060",
              "_parent": {
                "$ref": "c4-pkg-2056"
              },
              "name": "Region builder",
              "stereotype": {
                "$ref": "c4-st-0009"
              },
              "documentation": "Technology: project.mjs\n\nStarts 1200ms before the first click and ends 1600ms after the last, at depth 3, with focus clamped to 0.08..0.92 so a corner click still frames something."
            },
            {
              "_type": "UMLClass",
              "_id": "c4-el-2061",
              "_parent": {
                "$ref": "c4-pkg-2056"
              },
              "name": "Focus track builder",
              "stereotype": {
                "$ref": "c4-st-0009"
              },
              "documentation": "Technology: project.mjs\n\nKeeps every click position in a cluster, not only the last. A merged region can span clicks far apart on screen, and the compositor pans across them instead of framing the final one and leaving the earlier ones off screen."
            },
            {
              "_type": "UMLClass",
              "_id": "c4-el-2062",
              "_parent": {
                "$ref": "c4-pkg-2056"
              },
              "name": "Project writer",
              "stereotype": {
                "$ref": "c4-st-0009"
              },
              "documentation": "Technology: {take}.recordly · JSON\n\nvideoPath plus the regions, and it prints each region with its focus track so the framing can be reviewed before composing."
            },
            {
              "_type": "UMLClassDiagram",
              "_id": "c4-dgm-2063",
              "_parent": {
                "$ref": "c4-pkg-2056"
              },
              "name": "C4-L3 — Components · Zoom Projector (project.mjs)",
              "documentation": "Level 3, container \"4 · Zoom Projector\".",
              "defaultDiagram": false,
              "ownedViews": [
